<title>USA: Alliant Techsystems names chairman.</title>
<headline>Alliant Techsystems names chairman.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alliant Techsystems said its board has elected Richard Schwartz chairman of the board, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Schwartz will continue to hold the titles of president and chief executive officer, which he assumed in January 1995.</p>
<p>R. Keith Elliott, who has served as Alliant's chair since March 1995, will continue to serve on Alliant's board of directors, the company said.</p>
</text>
